id: zooner-raised-mark
name: Zooner-Raised
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 2
# Not a Combat Condition: Zooner-Raised (3)'s and (4)'s - a stack for each taken on the attack.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Zooner-Raised: Awareness, Defense Value and Soak Value 1(bT) lower till the start of your next turn.
text: >
  Zooner-Raised (3), (4): After concluding that Attacking Maneuver, reduce your Awareness, Defense Value, and Soak Value by 1(bT) until the start of your next turn.

---

[passive per stack]
awareness -= 1(bT);
defenseValue -= 1(bT);
soakValue -= 1(bT);
